### Manual tests against the running app (./mvnw spring-boot:run)
### Open in IntelliJ / VS Code (REST Client extension) and click "Send Request".

### 1. Generate a quiz with the REAL AI (takes a few seconds)
POST http://localhost:8084/api/quizzes/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "Java streams",
  "difficulty": "MEDIUM",
  "numberOfQuestions": 3
}

### 2. List all quizzes
GET http://localhost:8084/api/quizzes

### 3. Get one quiz (no correct answers shown)
GET http://localhost:8084/api/quizzes/1

### 4. Submit answers (one index 0-3 per question)
POST http://localhost:8084/api/quizzes/1/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": [0, 2, 1]
}

### 5. See previous attempts
GET http://localhost:8084/api/quizzes/1/attempts

### --- Error cases ---

### 6. Invalid body -> 400
POST http://localhost:8084/api/quizzes/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "topic": "",
  "difficulty": "MEDIUM",
  "numberOfQuestions": 20
}

### 7. Unknown quiz -> 404
GET http://localhost:8084/api/quizzes/9999
